  "format": "vegan plant_props / rich_plant_props presets",
  "notes": [
    "generator \"plant\" = blade plants (grass, rosettes): props are the 31 plant_props fields, in plant_system.cpp / PLANT_PROP_NAMES order, for plant_generate. generator \"rich\" = stem + leaves + flower: the 38 rich_plant_props fields for rich_plant_generate. Apply with: for (k in props) binder[k] = props[k].",
    "Units: 1 unit = 1 m. A habitat covers a size_m x size_m square. Every value lies inside the tests.js slider ranges. density_per_m2 is a typical stand density used by the habitats below, in tufts/plants per square metre.",
    "Vertex colour alpha carries a per-part wind phase (not opacity); force alpha to 1 when drawing with an alpha-tested material.",
    "plant_estimate_max_verts ignores the geometry flowerChance adds (e.g. wheat ears), so size output buffers well above it."
